    (comment 1 "SOURCE for this board - edit in KiCad 9. board-netlist.yaml is exported from it: python3 tools/kicad.py export hardware/boards/matrix-carrier")
    (comment 2 "The Matrix on two 1x10 headers, hung from the oak top; J1 (J-MCU-C) is the Matrix ribbon's carrier end, standing down from the arm beside J-MCU (ADR 0018, Amendment of 2026-11-21)")
